    <bpmn:process id="W_W4034" name="W4034. Campaign-Finance, Contribution-Limit &amp; Prohibited-Donation Controls" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Contribution request; spend decision; election cycle
Frequency: On request + maintained controls
Volume: Heavily restricted
Owner: VP Legal / CFO
Participants: Legal, Finance (links to VS-17.4), Compliance (links to VS-119), ABC (links to VS-86), Govt Affairs (links to VS-104), CEO, Board
Source: workflow W4034 — Campaign-Finance, Contribution-Limit &amp; Prohibited-Donation Controls</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4034_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4034_Lane1" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4034_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4034_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4034_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4034_Lane2" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4034_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4034_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4034_Start4" name="Contribution request; spend decision; election cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4034_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4034_Task5" name="Legal/Finance maintain the campaign-finance/contribution control: the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Legal/Finance maintain the campaign-finance/contribution control: the prohibition on direct/indirect corporate contributions to candidates, parties, and election campaigns under the Omnibus Election Code Art. XI §95 (incl. the §95(3) government-contractor/supplier prohibition relevant to BuildRight&#x27;s B2G business) and RA 7166 campaign-finance rules, with RA 9006 governing propaganda/airtime limits (with criminal liability for officers/agents); the screening of any spend that could be indirect support; and Board authority for any political-adjacent spend
Responsible (R): Legal / Finance / Compliance
Accountable (A): VP Legal / CFO
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4034_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4034_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4034_Task6" name="Legal/Compliance review flagged spend (sponsorships, donations, in-kind…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Legal/Compliance review flagged spend (sponsorships, donations, in-kind, candidate-linked events/charities, advertising near elections) for electoral nexus, apply ABC (links to VS-86) and anti-graft (links to W4037) controls, and approve or decline with documented rationale
Responsible (R): Legal / Compliance
Accountable (A): CEO / Board
Duration: Per request</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4034_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4034_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4034_Task7" name="Finance/Legal record and disclose any permitted political-adjacent spend (links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance/Legal record and disclose any permitted political-adjacent spend (links to W4032) and report to the Board Audit Committee (links to VS-36)
Responsible (R): Finance / Legal
Accountable (A): Board Audit Committee
Duration: Per event + periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4034_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4034_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4034_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4034_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-627 (ensure controlled execution — Election-Period Compliance, Political Contributions &amp; Lobbying Controls (PA-132.2).) | - operational: prohibition, screening, and Board authority; operational: nexus review
Owner: VP Legal / CFO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4034_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4034_Annotation9" targetRef="W4034_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4034_Flow11" sourceRef="W4034_Start4" targetRef="W4034_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4034_Flow12" sourceRef="W4034_Task5" targetRef="W4034_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4034_Flow13" sourceRef="W4034_Task6" targetRef="W4034_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4034_Flow14" sourceRef="W4034_Task7" targetRef="W4034_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
