    <bpmn:process id="W_W4035" name="W4035. Election-Period Marketing, Advertising &amp; Promotion Restrictions" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Election period; marketing campaign; sensitive context
Frequency: Per election cycle + per campaign
Volume: All marketing/advertising (links to VS-14)
Owner: VP Legal / CMO
Participants: Legal, Marketing (links to VS-14.1/VS-14.2), Corporate Communications (links to VS-14.3), Retail Media (links to VS-48), Store Ops (links to VS-07), Compliance
Source: workflow W4035 — Election-Period Marketing, Advertising &amp; Promotion Restrictions</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4035_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4035_Lane1" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4035_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4035_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4035_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4035_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4035_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4035_Start3" name="Election period; marketing campaign; sensitive context">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4035_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4035_Task4" name="Legal/Marketing map election-period restrictions on BuildRight advertising and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Legal/Marketing map election-period restrictions on BuildRight advertising and promotions: COMELEC rules on election propaganda and blackout periods, the risk that BuildRight ads (featuring officials, timed near events, or near polling places) constitute indirect electioneering, and restrictions on political advertising on BuildRight&#x27;s media channels/retail-media network
Responsible (R): Legal / Marketing / Retail Media
Accountable (A): VP Legal / CMO
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4035_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4035_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4035_Task5" name="Legal/Marketing implement pre-publication review of election-period campaigns…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Legal/Marketing implement pre-publication review of election-period campaigns, ensure no candidate/party imagery/endorsement, manage retail-media and in-store signage to exclude political content, and apply blackout-period rules
Responsible (R): Legal / Marketing / Store Ops
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4035_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4035_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4035_Task6" name="Legal/Marketing monitor compliance, manage any takedowns/corrections, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Legal/Marketing monitor compliance, manage any takedowns/corrections, and document for disclosure (links to W4032) and lessons
Responsible (R): Legal / Marketing
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4035_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4035_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4035_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4035_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-627 (ensure controlled execution — Election-Period Compliance, Political Contributions &amp; Lobbying Controls (PA-132.2).) | - operational: pre-publication review and content rules; operational: content policy and takedown
Owner: VP Legal / CMO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4035_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4035_Annotation8" targetRef="W4035_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
