    <bpmn:process id="W_W4036" name="W4036. Candidate Engagement, Endorsement &amp; Non-Partisanship Governance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Candidate visit/request; endorsement question; photo/event
Frequency: On event + maintained policy
Volume: Occasional
Owner: VP Legal / Government Affairs Manager
Participants: Legal, Govt Affairs (links to VS-104), Corporate Communications (links to VS-14.3), Store Ops (links to VS-07), Compliance (links to VS-119)
Source: workflow W4036 — Candidate Engagement, Endorsement &amp; Non-Partisanship Governance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4036_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4036_Lane1" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4036_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4036_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4036_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4036_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4036_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4036_Start3" name="Candidate visit/request; endorsement question; photo/event">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4036_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4036_Task4" name="Legal/Govt-Affairs maintain the candidate-engagement/endorsement governance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Legal/Govt-Affairs maintain the candidate-engagement/endorsement governance: BuildRight does not endorse candidates/parties; candidate/official visits to stores/events are managed neutrally (no implied endorsement, no campaign activity, no use for partisan purposes); and any engagement is documented
Responsible (R): Legal / Govt Affairs
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4036_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4036_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4036_Task5" name="Legal/Comms manage any candidate/official visit, photo, or event to preserve…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Legal/Comms manage any candidate/official visit, photo, or event to preserve non-partisanship, avoid appearance of endorsement, and comply with election-period restrictions (links to W4033) and anti-graft (links to W4037)
