      <bpmn:userTask id="W4037_Task4" name="Legal/Compliance maintain the government-official interaction and anti-graft…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Legal/Compliance maintain the government-official interaction and anti-graft controls under RA 3019 (Anti-Graft) and RA 6713 (Code of Conduct for Public Officials): prohibitions on gifts/favors/hospitality to public officials (overlapping with ABC links to VS-86), documentation of official interactions, and conduct standards for B2G sales (links to VS-46) and govt-affairs staff (links to VS-104)
Responsible (R): Legal / Compliance
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
