Responsible (R): Legal / HR
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Per hire</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4038_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4038_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
