    <bpmn:process id="W_W4040" name="W4040. Political Intelligence, Monitoring &amp; Early-Warning System" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Continuous monitoring; election cycle; regulatory development
Frequency: Continuous + periodic brief
Volume: Enterprise
Owner: Government Affairs Manager / VP Legal
Participants: Govt Affairs (links to VS-104), Legal, Insights (links to VS-44), Strategy (links to VS-33), Compliance, external monitoring services
Source: workflow W4040 — Political Intelligence, Monitoring &amp; Early-Warning System</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4040_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4040_Lane1" name="Govt Affairs">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4040_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4040_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4040_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4040_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4040_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4040_Start3" name="Continuous monitoring; election cycle; regulatory development">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4040_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4040_Task4" name="Govt Affairs/Insights maintain the political-intelligence and early-warning…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Govt Affairs/Insights maintain the political-intelligence and early-warning system: monitoring of legislation/regulation, election calendars and outcomes, political risk by region/LGU, enforcement trends (anti-graft, election-law, ABC), and stakeholder/NGO/media signals
Responsible (R): Govt Affairs / Insights
Accountable (A): Government Affairs Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4040_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4040_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4040_Task5" name="Govt Affairs/Legal assess exposure and impact on BuildRight (operations, B2G…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Govt Affairs/Legal assess exposure and impact on BuildRight (operations, B2G links to VS-46, supply chain links to VS-02, multi-LGU links to VS-76), and issue early warnings/briefs to leadership and affected units
Responsible (R): Govt Affairs / Legal / Strategy
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Periodic + on event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4040_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4040_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4040_Task6" name="Govt Affairs feed intelligence into strategy (links to VS-33), engagement…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Govt Affairs feed intelligence into strategy (links to VS-33), engagement planning (links to VS-104), risk assessment (W4026), and Board reporting (links to VS-36/W4048)
Responsible (R): Govt Affairs
Accountable (A): Government Affairs Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4040_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4040_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4040_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4040_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-627 (ensure controlled execution — Election-Period Compliance, Political Contributions &amp; Lobbying Controls (PA-132.2).) | - operational: continuous monitoring and early-warning briefs; operational: impact assessment and prioritization
Owner: Government Affairs Manager / VP Legal</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
